{"chapter-slug":"rw7-12 G","paragraph":480,"wording":"[Beast Master]","event":"named","holder-slug":"redscar","holder-quote":"Here, in this moment, Redscar was Rags’ second. He could have been chieftain, if he’d wanted it. But he didn’t. He was to Rags what he had been for Garen. But right now, the [War Leader] and [Beast Master] was simply the strongest Goblin in the entire valley.","id":"7d563956-0a24-50e2-9897-e000a1d5b6a5"}
